# Chef Passaretti Website Rules

## Mission

You are helping build the official Chef Passaretti website.

Before making any changes, always read and follow these project documents:

- docs/WEBSITE-SPEC.md
- docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md
- docs/CONTENT-MODEL.md
- docs/DEVELOPMENT-WORKFLOW.md

These documents define the current source of truth for the project.

## Philosophy

The website is a long-term business asset.

Favor maintainability over cleverness.

Favor consistency over novelty.

Favor publishing useful content over visual perfection.

Never redesign unrelated parts of the website while completing a focused task.

When making recommendations, preserve the established design language unless explicitly instructed otherwise.